{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-george-ladies-double-buckle-flatbed-sandal-sold-by-asda-2511-0181","content_id":"22d528d9-aece-4be6-afa1-5873dd459598","description":"Product Recall for George Ladies Double Buckle Flatbed Sandal sold by Asda presenting a serious chemical risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"17a73842-f6a7-468e-84b3-5692501868b9","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2025-11-21T09:36:25+00:00","id":"17a73842-f6a7-468e-84b3-5692501868b9","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2025-11-21T09:36:25+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/692032995c394e481336ab4f/2511-0181-product-recall-asda-double-buckle-sandals.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: George Ladies Double Buckle Flatbed Sandal sold by Asda.</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as the nickel content is greater than the maximum permissible limit.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Clothing, Textiles and Fashion items – Shoes</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>George</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcodes</td>\n      <td>5059201862196, 5059201862219, 5059201862233, 5059201862271, 5059201862257, 5059201862295, 5059201862318, 5059201862332, 5059201372015, 5059201372039 5059201372053, 5059201372091, 5059201372077, 5059201372213, 5059201372237, 5059201372251, 5059201341790, 5059201342018, 5059201342032, 5059201342070, 5059201342056, 5059201342094, 5059201342117, 5059201342131</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Unknown</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Double buckle sandals in lilac and sage colours.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_17a73842-f6a7-468e-84b3-5692501868b9\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/692032995c394e481336ab4f/2511-0181-product-recall-asda-double-buckle-sandals.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk as the nickel content is greater than the maximum permissible limit. Nickel is a skin sensitiser and can cause allergic reactions if present in products that come into direct and prolonged contact with the skin.\nFurther information on the health effects of nickel exposure can be accessed on Gov.uk at the following link: <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/nickel-properties-incident-management-and-toxicology\">https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/nickel-properties-incident-management-and-toxicology</a> .</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the REACH Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users.\nOwners of the product are advised to stop using them and return them to the nearest ASDA, where a full refund will be given. A receipt is not required. No other colours are affected by the recall.</p>\n\n<p>For any further information, please contact: Asda Customer Relations – 0330 053 0111 or visit the website below: |\n<a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://corporate.asda.com/product-recall-george-ladies-double-buckle-flatbed-sandal\">https://corporate.asda.com/product-recall-george-ladies-double-buckle-flatbed-sandal</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0181</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2025-11-21T09:37:28Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"clothing-textiles-fashion","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2025-11-21","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2025-11-21T09:37:28+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-george-ladies-double-buckle-flatbed-sandal-sold-by-asda-2511-0181","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-george-ladies-double-buckle-flatbed-sandal-sold-by-asda-2511-0181","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-george-ladies-double-buckle-flatbed-sandal-sold-by-asda-2511-0181","content_id":"22d528d9-aece-4be6-afa1-5873dd459598","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-11-21T09:37:28Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: George Ladies Double Buckle Flatbed Sandal sold by Asda (2511-0181)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-george-ladies-double-buckle-flatbed-sandal-sold-by-asda-2511-0181","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-